Run this in terminal to get SHA-256 encrypted email address

read -s "GBI_SECRET?Paste EMAIL_LOOKUP_SECRET: "
echo
printf '%s' 'email address' | openssl dgst -sha256 -hmac "$GBI_SECRET"
unset GBI_SECRET

The terminal will ask you for EMAIL_LOOKUP_SECRET

